{"kind":"meta","id":"image/main","title":"影像處理（簡化版）","keywords":["影像","濾鏡","圖層","處理","反相","灰階"],"entry":"build","standalone":true}
{"kind":"param","name":"title","default":"影像處理","ask":"視窗標題要寫什麼？"}
{"kind":"param","name":"layer_max","default":"8","ask":"圖層最多可以疊幾層？"}
{"kind":"require","module":"gui","source":"builtin"}
{"kind":"style","palette":{"bg":"#ffffff","fg":"#1f2937","accent":"#2563eb","danger":"#dc2626","muted":"#6b7280"},"font":"sans-serif","size":14,"radius":6}
{"kind":"layout","window":{"title":"{{title}}","width":900,"resizable":true,"height":620},"tree":[{"kind":"column","role":"page","children":[{"slot":"toolbar"},{"kind":"row","grow":1,"children":[{"id":"left","kind":"column","role":"sidebar","children":[{"kind":"label","text":"工具（點選後加入圖層）","role":"heading"},{"id":"tools","kind":"list","items":["反相","灰階","提亮","變暗","紅色通道"],"selected":"反相","grow":1},{"id":"add","kind":"button","text":"加入圖層","role":"primary"}]},{"id":"right","kind":"column","grow":1,"pad":16,"gap":10,"children":[{"id":"preview","kind":"canvas","width":312,"height":208,"fit":true,"grow":3},{"kind":"label","text":"圖層（由下往上套用）","role":"heading"},{"id":"layers","kind":"list","items":[],"grow":1}]}]},{"id":"actions","kind":"row","pad":10,"children":[{"id":"open_img","kind":"button","text":"開啟圖片"},{"id":"orig","kind":"button","text":"看原圖比對"},{"id":"note","kind":"label","text":"原圖（未套用任何圖層）","role":"muted"},{"id":"back","kind":"button","text":"回到編輯","role":"primary"}]},{"slot":"statusbar"}]}]}
{"kind":"slot","name":"toolbar","use":"image/toolbar"}
{"kind":"slot","name":"statusbar","use":"image/statusbar"}
{"kind":"scene","id":"edit","title":"編輯中","note":"工具、圖層與預覽","show":["left","right","orig","open_img"],"hide":["note","back"],"on":{"click:orig":"compare"}}
{"kind":"scene","id":"compare","title":"比對原圖","note":"只顯示原圖","show":["right","note","back"],"hide":["left","orig","open_img"],"on":{"click:back":"edit"}}
{"kind":"shortcut","keys":"Ctrl+Enter","do":"add"}
{"kind":"shortcut","keys":"Ctrl+Z","do":"undo"}
